{"id":"spasenie","lemma":"спасение","pos":"noun","rank":1897,"glosses":["rescue, salvation (act of rescuing, saving)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c0/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"спасения","plural":"спасения"},"examples":[{"text":"Спасения нет.","en":"There's no escape.","words":[null,{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"Кто звонил в службу спасения?","en":"Who called 911?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to call","l":"звонить"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Наше спасение было не чем иным, как чудом.","en":"Our escape was nothing short of a miracle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334113","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"than"},null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"miraculously"}]},{"text":"Думаю, нам нужно позвонить в службу спасения.","en":"I think we need to call 911.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"to call"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Том поблагодарил Мэри за спасение.","en":"Tom thanked Mary for saving him.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to thank","l":"поблагодарить"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},null]}]}